    |
    = note: A position belongs to exactly one text, which the compiler follows through names, parameters and branches; a field keeps its own sources, so a text field beside it is no tie (ADR-374 D5, D6).
    = help: Hold the text and the position together in a `text::Cursor`: `text::Cursor(t)`, `c.at()`, `c.go(p)`, `c.until(needle)`, `c.rest()`.
